[
  {
    "pkheadingid": 457,
    "bookid": 34,
    "headingType": 2,
    "headingTitle": "Definition",
    "headingPosition": 1,
    "headingid": 370,
    "contributions": [
      {
        "pkcontributionId": 61678,
        "bookId": 34,
        "chapterId": 32,
        "headingId": 370,
        "headingText": "\r\n<p>Clear cell cystadenoma and adenofibroma are benign epithelial tumours composed of small, round glands containing bland clear or oxyphilic cells with a variable fibromatous stroma.</p>\r\n",
        "timestamp": "2020-05-13T16:37:37"
      }
    ],
    "booknotes": [],
    "numberofBooknote": 0
  },
  {
    "pkheadingid": 458,
    "bookid": 34,
    "headingType": 2,
    "headingTitle": "ICD-O coding",
    "headingPosition": 2,
    "headingid": 371,
    "contributions": [
      {
        "pkcontributionId": 61679,
        "bookId": 34,
        "chapterId": 32,
        "headingId": 371,
        "headingText": "\r\n<p>8443/0 Clear cell cystadenoma</p>\r\n<p>8313/0 Clear cell cystadenofibroma</p>\r\n",
        "timestamp": "2020-05-13T16:37:37"
      }
    ],
    "booknotes": [],
    "numberofBooknote": 0
  },
  {
    "pkheadingid": 459,
    "bookid": 34,
    "headingType": 2,
    "headingTitle": "ICD-11 coding",
    "headingPosition": 3,
    "headingid": 372,
    "contributions": [
      {
        "pkcontributionId": 61680,
        "bookId": 34,
        "chapterId": 32,
        "headingId": 372,
        "headingText": "\r\n<p>2F32.Y &amp; XH9JJ4 Other specified benign neoplasm of ovary &amp; Clear cell adenofibroma</p>\r\n<p>2F32.Y &amp; XH6ZU1 Other specified benign neoplasm of ovary &amp; Clear cell cystadenoma</p>\r\n",
        "timestamp": "2020-05-13T16:37:37"
      }
    ],
    "booknotes": [],
    "numberofBooknote": 0
  },
  {
    "pkheadingid": 460,
    "bookid": 34,
    "headingType": 2,
    "headingTitle": "Related terminology",
    "headingPosition": 4,
    "headingid": 373,
    "contributions": [
      {
        "pkcontributionId": 61681,
        "bookId": 34,
        "chapterId": 32,
        "headingId": 373,
        "headingText": "\r\n<p><em>Acceptable:</em> clear cell cystadenofibroma</p>\r\n",
        "timestamp": "2020-05-13T16:37:37"
      }
    ],
    "booknotes": [],
    "numberofBooknote": 0
  },
  {
    "pkheadingid": 461,
    "bookid": 34,
    "headingType": 2,
    "headingTitle": "Subtype(s)",
    "headingPosition": 5,
    "headingid": 374,
    "contributions": [
      {
        "pkcontributionId": 61682,
        "bookId": 34,
        "chapterId": 32,
        "headingId": 374,
        "headingText": "\r\n<p>None</p>\r\n",
        "timestamp": "2020-05-13T16:37:37"
      }
    ],
    "booknotes": [],
    "numberofBooknote": 0
  },
  {
    "pkheadingid": 462,
    "bookid": 34,
    "headingType": 2,
    "headingTitle": "Localization",
    "headingPosition": 6,
    "headingid": 375,
    "contributions": [
      {
        "pkcontributionId": 61683,
        "bookId": 34,
        "chapterId": 32,
        "headingId": 375,
        "headingText": "\r\n<p>Ovary</p>\r\n",
        "timestamp": "2020-05-13T16:37:37"
      }
    ],
    "booknotes": [],
    "numberofBooknote": 0
  },
  {
    "pkheadingid": 463,
    "bookid": 34,
    "headingType": 2,
    "headingTitle": "Clinical features",
    "headingPosition": 7,
    "headingid": 376,
    "contributions": [
      {
        "pkcontributionId": 61684,
        "bookId": 34,
        "chapterId": 32,
        "headingId": 376,
        "headingText": "\r\n<p>Pure clear cell cystadenoma may be an incidental finding, or patients may present with symptoms of a pelvic mass. The median patient age is early in the sixth decade of life (range: 18&ndash;63&nbsp;years). Almost all cases are unilateral.</p>\r\n",
        "timestamp": "2020-05-13T16:37:37"
      }
    ],
    "booknotes": [],
    "numberofBooknote": 0
  },
  {
    "pkheadingid": 464,
    "bookid": 34,
    "headingType": 2,
    "headingTitle": "Epidemiology",
    "headingPosition": 8,
    "headingid": 377,
    "contributions": [
      {
        "pkcontributionId": 61685,
        "bookId": 34,
        "chapterId": 32,
        "headingId": 377,
        "headingText": "\r\n<p>The incidence is unknown due to rarity; only small case series exist in the literature {514560; 6692303; 4052962; 21479128}.</p>\r\n",
        "timestamp": "2020-05-13T16:37:37"
      }
    ],
    "booknotes": [],
    "numberofBooknote": 0
  },
  {
    "pkheadingid": 465,
    "bookid": 34,
    "headingType": 2,
    "headingTitle": "Etiology",
    "headingPosition": 9,
    "headingid": 378,
    "contributions": [
      {
        "pkcontributionId": 61686,
        "bookId": 34,
        "chapterId": 32,
        "headingId": 378,
        "headingText": "\r\n<p>Unknown</p>\r\n",
        "timestamp": "2020-05-13T16:37:37"
      }
    ],
    "booknotes": [],
    "numberofBooknote": 0
  },
  {
    "pkheadingid": 466,
    "bookid": 34,
    "headingType": 2,
    "headingTitle": "Pathogenesis",
    "headingPosition": 10,
    "headingid": 379,
    "contributions": [
      {
        "pkcontributionId": 61687,
        "bookId": 34,
        "chapterId": 32,
        "headingId": 379,
        "headingText": "\r\n<p>Clear cell cystadenoma has been reported to arise in association with endometriosis {6692303; 4052962; 21479128}.</p>\r\n",
        "timestamp": "2020-05-13T16:37:37"
      }
    ],
    "booknotes": [],
    "numberofBooknote": 0
  },
  {
    "pkheadingid": 473,
    "bookid": 34,
    "headingType": 2,
    "headingTitle": "Macroscopic appearance",
    "headingPosition": 11,
    "headingid": 386,
    "contributions": [
      {
        "pkcontributionId": 61688,
        "bookId": 34,
        "chapterId": 32,
        "headingId": 386,
        "headingText": "\r\n<p>These tumours are almost always unilateral. Clear cell cystadenoma forms a solid, fibromatous mass, which often contains small cysts. The surface is smooth and lobulated. Reported tumour sizes range from 3.5 to 26&nbsp;cm {514560; 6692303; 4052962; 21479128}.</p>\r\n",
        "timestamp": "2020-05-13T16:37:37"
      }
    ],
    "booknotes": [],
    "numberofBooknote": 0
  },
  {
    "pkheadingid": 467,
    "bookid": 34,
    "headingType": 2,
    "headingTitle": "Histopathology",
    "headingPosition": 12,
    "headingid": 380,
    "contributions": [
      {
        "pkcontributionId": 61689,
        "bookId": 34,
        "chapterId": 32,
        "headingId": 380,
        "headingText": "\r\n<p>Clear cell cystadenomas contain small to medium-sized, widely spaced glands in a fibromatous stroma. Constituent cells are bland, flat or low cuboidal, clear, or eosinophilic. Nuclei are small, without chromatin abnormalities or nucleoli. Mitotic activity is typically absent. Extensive sampling is required to exclude borderline tumour or carcinoma. Papillae, crowded glands, nuclear atypia, and stromal desmoplasia are exclusionary.</p>\r\n",
        "timestamp": "2020-05-13T16:37:37"
      }
    ],
    "booknotes": [],
    "numberofBooknote": 0
  },
  {
    "pkheadingid": 468,
    "bookid": 34,
    "headingType": 2,
    "headingTitle": "Cytology",
    "headingPosition": 13,
    "headingid": 381,
    "contributions": [
      {
        "pkcontributionId": 61690,
        "bookId": 34,
        "chapterId": 32,
        "headingId": 381,
        "headingText": "\r\n<p>Not clinically relevant</p>\r\n",
        "timestamp": "2020-05-13T16:37:37"
      }
    ],
    "booknotes": [],
    "numberofBooknote": 0
  },
  {
    "pkheadingid": 469,
    "bookid": 34,
    "headingType": 2,
    "headingTitle": "Diagnostic molecular pathology",
    "headingPosition": 14,
    "headingid": 382,
    "contributions": [
      {
        "pkcontributionId": 61691,
        "bookId": 34,
        "chapterId": 32,
        "headingId": 382,
        "headingText": "\r\n<p>Not clinically relevant</p>\r\n",
        "timestamp": "2020-05-13T16:37:37"
      }
    ],
    "booknotes": [],
    "numberofBooknote": 0
  },
  {
    "pkheadingid": 472,
    "bookid": 34,
    "headingType": 2,
    "headingTitle": "Essential and desirable diagnostic criteria",
    "headingPosition": 15,
    "headingid": 385,
    "contributions": [
      {
        "pkcontributionId": 61692,
        "bookId": 34,
        "chapterId": 32,
        "headingId": 385,
        "headingText": "\r\n<p><em>Essential:</em> cystic/adenofibromatous clear cell tumour lacking nuclear atypia and stromal invasion.</p>\r\n",
        "timestamp": "2020-05-13T16:37:37"
      }
    ],
    "booknotes": [],
    "numberofBooknote": 0
  },
  {
    "pkheadingid": 470,
    "bookid": 34,
    "headingType": 2,
    "headingTitle": "Staging",
    "headingPosition": 16,
    "headingid": 383,
    "contributions": [
      {
        "pkcontributionId": 61693,
        "bookId": 34,
        "chapterId": 32,
        "headingId": 383,
        "headingText": "\r\n<p>Not clinically relevant</p>\r\n",
        "timestamp": "2020-05-13T16:37:37"
      }
    ],
    "booknotes": [],
    "numberofBooknote": 0
  },
  {
    "pkheadingid": 471,
    "bookid": 34,
    "headingType": 2,
    "headingTitle": "Prognosis and prediction",
    "headingPosition": 17,
    "headingid": 384,
    "contributions": [
      {
        "pkcontributionId": 61694,
        "bookId": 34,
        "chapterId": 32,
        "headingId": 384,
        "headingText": "\r\n<p>By definition, these tumours are benign.</p>",
        "timestamp": "2020-05-13T16:37:37"
      }
    ],
